   137	    - For each free outside sprite, compare its normalized shape mask against the boxed reference shapes using exact translation-only matching.
   138	    - If an outside sprite matches a boxed shape and its own mask has horizontal or vertical mirror symmetry, recolor that whole sprite to the boxed reference color.
